    {
      "contentExcerpt": "\n\nI'll make a small, coherent accessibility improvement: add `<noscript>` fallbacks for the \"Copy UTC time\" button on the two remaining pages that have it (404.html and colophon.html), matching the pattern already established in how-it-works.html. This makes the site consistent for visitors with JavaScript disabled.\n\n```file:site/404.html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Page not found \u2013 Momento\">\n <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex\">\n <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#0f1117\">\n <title>404 \u2013 Page Not Found \u00b7 Momento</title>\n <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"skip-link.css\">\n <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"favicon.svg\">\n</head>\n<body>\n <a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main-content\">Skip to main content</a>\n <main id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n <header class=\"nav\">\n <nav>\n<a href=\"index.html\">Home</a>\n<a href=\"how-it-works.html\">How It Works</a>\n<a href=\"updates.html\">Updates</a>\n<a href=\"contribute.html\">Contribute</a>\n<a href=\"license.html\">License</a>\n<a href=\"privacy.html\">Privacy</a>\n<a href=\"log.html\">Wake Log</a>\n<a href=\"colophon.html\">Colophon</a>\n<a href=\"notes.html\">Notes</a>\n<a href=\"while-i-sleep.html\">While I Sleep</a>\n<a href=\"colophon.html#accessibility\">Accessibility</a>\n <a href=\"https://github.com/s04/momento\" id=\"github-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GitHub</a>\n <button id=\"star-btn\" class=\"star-btn\" aria-label=\"Star this repository on GitHub\">\u2b50 Star</button>\n <p>&copy; 2026 Momento</p>\n <button id=\"dark-mode-toggle\" class=\"dark-mode-btn\" aria-label=\"Toggle dark mode\">\ud83c\udf19 Dark mode</button>\n </nav>\n </header>\n <section class=\"panel\">\n <h2>404 \u2013 Page Not Found</h2>\n <p>The page you were looking for doesn't exist or may have moved.</p>\n <p>Try one of these instead:</p>\n <ul>\n <li><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a> \u2013 current wake status and live stats</li>\n <li><a href=\"how-it-works.html\">How It Works</a> \u2013 what Momento does each waking</li>\n <li><a href=\"updates.html\">Updates</a> \u2013 recent improvements to the site</li>\n <li><a href=\"log.html\">Wake Log</a> \u2013 history of Momento's wakings</li>\n <li><a href=\"colophon.html\">Colophon</a> \u2013 about this site and accessibility</li>\n <li><a href=\"while-i-sleep.html\">While I Sleep</a> \u2013 quiet-period documentation</li>\n </ul>\n <p>Or visit the <a href=\"https://github.com/s04/momento\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GitHub repository</a> to browse the source.</p>\n </section>\n <section class=\"panel promise\">\n <p>This site is open source. The source code is in the <a href=\"https://github.com/s04/momento\">Momento repository</a>.</p>\n </section>\n <section class=\"panel\">\n <button id=\"print-page-btn\" class=\"copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Print this page\">\ud83d\udda8\ufe0f Print</button>\n <button id=\"copy-url-btn\" class=\"copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy this page URL\">\ud83d\udd17 Copy URL</button>\n <button id=\"report-broken-link-btn\" class=\"copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Report this broken link\">\ud83d\udc1b Report broken link</button>\n <button id=\"copy-current-time-btn\" class=\"copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy current UTC time\">\u23f0 Copy UTC time</button>\n <noscript>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--muted);\">The \"Copy UTC time\" button requires JavaScript to function.</p>\n </noscript>\n </section>\n <p style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 2rem;\"><a href=\"#main-content\">\u2191 Back to top</a></p>\n </main>\n <footer class=\"footer\">\n <nav>\n<a href=\"index.html\">Home</a>\n<a href=\"how-it-works.html\">How It Works</a>\n<a href=\"updates.html\">Updates</a>\n<a href=\"contribute.html\">Contribute</a>\n<a href=\"license.html\">License</a>\n<a href=\"privacy.html\">Privacy</a>\n<a href=\"log.html\">Wake Log</a>\n<a href=\"colophon.html\">Colophon</a>\n<a href=\"notes.html\">Notes</a>\n<a href=\"while-i-sleep.html\">While I Sleep</a>\n<a href=\"colophon.html#accessibility\">Accessibility</a>\n <a href=\"https://github.com/s04/momento\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GitHub</a>\n <p>&copy; 2026 Momento</p>\n </nav>\n <p id=\"last-updated-badge\">\n... truncated ...\n",
